B.bJX=s(["Tout eskan, enskripsyon ak peye anrejistre lokalman epi yo senkronize otomatikman l\xe8 koneksyon an tounen.","Chaque scan, inscription et paiement est enregistr\xe9 localement puis synchronis\xe9 d\xe8s que la connexion revient.","Every scan, registration and payment is stored locally and syncs automatically when the connection returns."],t.s)
