B.bOH=s(["Mesaj WhatsApp yo pap pati pou manm ou yo. Tanpri kontakte SecurGYM pou renouvle ab\xf2nman s\xe8vis WhatsApp gym ou a.","Les messages WhatsApp ne partiront pas pour vos membres. Veuillez contacter SecurGYM pour renouveler l'abonnement WhatsApp.","WhatsApp messages will not be sent to members. Please contact SecurGYM to renew your WhatsApp subscription."],t.s)
B.bB2=s(["\ud83d\udee1\ufe0f Pwoteksyon Anti-Spam aktif: yon del\xe8 sekirite ant 2 a 4 segonn aplike otomatikman ant chak mesaj pou evite WhatsApp bloke kont ou.","\ud83d\udee1\ufe0f Protection Anti-Spam active : un d\xe9lai de s\xe9curit\xe9 de 2 \xe0 4 secondes est appliqu\xe9 automatiquement entre chaque message pour \xe9viter tout blocage WhatsApp.","\ud83d\udee1\ufe0f Anti-Spam protection active: a safety delay of 2 to 4 seconds is automatically applied between messages to prevent WhatsApp bans."],t.s)
